OL,3,AWhy is Elon Musk plotting a mega-merger
OL,4,Aof SpaceX and Tesla?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith Tesla valued at roughly $1.5
OL,7,Ftrillion (#1.1 trillion) and SpaceX at
OL,8,F$2 trillion, a combination of the two
OL,9,Fcompanies would mark the largest merger
OL,10,Fever.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
