OL,3,AAli G is back. But is the character
OL,4,Apast its sell-by date?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, more than 300 fans
OL,7,Fattended an official Ali G lookalike
OL,8,Fcompetition, ferried around London on
OL,9,Fan open-top bus that stopped at
OL,10,Flandmarks including Big Ben, Leicester
OL,11,FSquare and Covent Garden.
OL,13,FThe stunt was promotion for an upcoming
OL,14,Fsequel to 2002 film Ali G Indahouse -
OL,15,Fcalled Ali G: Who iz I? - which hits
OL,16,Fcinemas on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
