OL,3,AKatie Razzall: BBC closures make
OL,4,Abusiness sense, but far more savings
OL,5,Aare needed
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Scotland's TV channel was watched,
OL,8,Faccording to this year's annual report,
OL,9,Fby a weekly average of 12% of the
OL,10,FScottish population. Scots simply
OL,11,Faren't tuning in in the numbers to make
OL,12,Fit cost-effective.
OL,14,F(Interestingly, BBC Alba, which is
OL,15,Faimed at Gaelic speakers and learners,
OL,16,Freached 43% of Gaelic viewers in
OL,17,FScotland weekly - was it boosted by its
OL,18,Frights to broadcast Italian football's
OL,19,FSerie A?)
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
